1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,210
What do you call it?

2
00:00:01,544 --> 00:00:06,180
Same product, different name depending on the language. At the market, nobody understands each other.

3
00:00:06,496 --> 00:00:07,845
AfroAtlas connects them.

4
00:00:08,179 --> 00:00:13,781
Type your name, you see all the others: Bassa, Duala, Ewondo, Bakweri...

5
00:00:14,094 --> 00:00:15,432
And every name has its source.

6
00:00:15,741 --> 00:00:18,440
One thousand thirty-five names. One hundred nineteen sources.

7
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:21,206
And not just Cameroon: thirteen countries already.

8
00:00:21,528 --> 00:00:22,622
Link in bio.
